{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The sea welcomes you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step aboard the <strong>33rd Warship</strong> in the <strong><i>Kindred [High Tide]</i> demo</strong>\u2014a mystery horror visual novel set deep in uncharted waters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Spend your first night on a vessel sent to investigate an unexplained anomaly at sea.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789550/extras/ezgif-51a51694022611.gif?t=1750362341\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your first challenge? Survive a harrowing encounter with a wayward beast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your second? Get to know your loyal crew--and choose your favorites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789550/extras/ezgif-6d673ff31061ee.gif?t=1750362341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Safety in numbers may only be a mirage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you trust your instincts\u2014and the men beside you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or will you hunt the danger down yourself, when it's most likely to strike?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789550/extras/ezgif-65f05c9e93cf9e.gif?t=1750362341\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a <strong>Cruel Dilemma.</strong>\u00a0<br>But the choice is yours to make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your first night at sea awaits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The High Tide beckons.</strong><br><i>Choose a side. Don\u2019t look back.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789550?t=1750362341","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789550?t=1750362341","c